    <item>
      <title>A Farewell To Kings – AF2K Rush Tribute (2026-11-22)</title>
      <link>https://lincolntheatre.com/event/a-farewell-to-kings-af2k-rush-tribute/lincoln-theatre/raleigh-north-carolina/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://lincolntheatre.com/event/a-farewell-to-kings-af2k-rush-tribute/lincoln-theatre/raleigh-north-carolina/</guid>
      <ev:startdate>2026-11-22</ev:startdate>
      <description><![CDATA[New Jersey’s A Farewell to Kings (AF2K) is an electrifying tribute to the legendary "Holy Triumvirate" of Rush. Armed with top-caliber gear and an obsessive attention to detail, their powerhouse lineup—Zack James (Vocals), Aaron Leone (Guitar), Adam Cyran (Bass/Keys), and Johnny Vines (Drums)—resurrects the magic of vintage Rush performances. Far more than a note-perfect recital, AF2K’s high-octane shows thrive on crowd connection, turning every venue into an interactive, shared celebration of progressive rock focusing on the authentic sonic and visual recreation of Rush’s live performances. Built from the ground up as a grassroots, community-driven organization, the band has fostered a tight-knit family of passionate fans who keep the spirit of Rush alive together. From sprawling epics to the rarest deep cuts, AF2K delivers a breathtaking, community-fueled experience that unites Rush devotees young and old.  Website:  https://af2ktribute.com/  Youtube: https://youtube.com/@af2ktribute     ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 10:16:54 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://lincolntheatre.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/a-farewell-to-kings-af2k-rush-tribute.jpeg"/>
    </item>
